{"articleNo":"133200","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=133200&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015 학습컨설팅 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.08.05","hit":"2688","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><strong></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> 맞춤형 '학습컨설팅' 신청 안내</span></strong></p><strong></strong><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>1. 대상</strong></span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;학습법 관련 상담이 필요한 모든 재학생(개인 또는 집단 상담)</span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\">&nbsp;</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2. 컨설팅 방법</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 상담 내용: 학습 및 학점 관리, 학습 상담, 자신감 회복</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 소요 시간: 1시간 내외</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 상담 주기: 2주 또는 4주(진단 결과에 따라 다름)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 상담 장소: 교수학습개발센터(벤처창업관 317호)</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\">&nbsp;</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋움\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청 안내 </span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 신청 기간: 방학 및 학기 중 상시</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 신청 방법: 유선(054-478-7352) 또는 센터 직접 방문</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; - 컨설턴트: 김혜경(센터 선임연구원, 교육학 박사)</span><br></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img style=\"HEIGHT: 46px; WIDTH: 177px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/bbd39a1d-1901-49d4-8c07-2b94e7256e91.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"97\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
